WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.700
Translate a routine. To eat dinner is have dinner, and the frequency word usually goes before the verb.

2
00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:17.800
“I have usually dinner” splits have from dinner. “I usually have dinner in nine” uses in with the time.

3
00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:24.600
“I usually have dinner at nine.” “eat dinner” or “normally” are also accepted.
